openjazz
------------------------------------------
OpenJazz is a free, open-source version of the classic Jazz Jackrabbit™
games.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libSDL2_2.0_0-2.32.74-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libSDL2-devel-2.32.74-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/AlisterT/openjazz/

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/AlisterT/openjazz/archive/refs/tags/20260301.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack openjazz-20260301-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./openjazz-20260301-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/openjazz-20260301-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/openjazz-20260301-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(openjazz)
  /etc/postinstall/openjazz.sh
  /usr/bin/OpenJazz.exe
  /usr/share/applications/OpenJazz.desktop
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/openjazz.README
  /usr/share/doc/openjazz/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/openjazz/README.md
  /usr/share/icons/hicolor/48x48/apps/OpenJazz.png
  /usr/share/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/OpenJazz.svg
  /usr/share/pixmaps/OpenJazz.png

